ark and scary environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure and survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy atmosphere with tense moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sounds to increase fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that unfolds as you play<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/c124bab2fc06d6e28263635041a791b6.avif?t=1763178867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras_big/c124bab2fc06d6e28263635041a791b6.avif?t=1763178867 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
